        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pistola d'Água. Clauncher detona gás dentro da garra direita para disparar água e atingir Pokémon voadores. Suas garras voltam a crescer quando caem. A carne dentro delas é comestível, mas possui um sabor peculiar que não agrada a todos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 1, Água 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Clauncher pode evoluir para Clawitzer no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Splash, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Vise Grip, Water Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Bubble</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Flail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bubble Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Hone Claws, Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Crabhammer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Water Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Smack Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Aura Sphere</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Aqua Jet, Bounce, Muddy Water</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Attract, Aura Sphere, Blizzard, Bounce, Chilling Water, Confide, Dark Pulse, Dive, Double Team, Dragon Pulse, Endure, Facade, Flash Cannon, Flip Turn, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Liquidation, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Muddy Water, Pounce, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Round, Scald, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Smack Down, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swords Dance, Take Down, Tera Blast, Terrain Pulse, Thief, Toxic, U-turn, Venoshock, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Weather Ball</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Jet, Aqua Tail, Bubble Beam, Crabhammer, Endure, Entrainment, Helping Hand</p>",
